4xl font-bold text-[hsl(25,20%,15%)] mb-6\">Bienvenue dans notre <span class=\"text-[hsl(25,55%,35%)]\">église</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 text-lg\">Nous vous souhaitons la bienvenue sur le site de l&#x27;Église Francophone CBCO Kintambo.</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Espérant que ces quelques pages vous feront plus connaître de nous, notre prière est qu&#x27;elles vous aident à vous rapprocher du Seigneur Jésus.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium mb-6 italic\">Bonne visite et que Le Seigneur vous bénisse !</p><a href=\"/a-propos\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-primary-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2 bg-[hsl(25,55%,35%)] hover:bg-[hsl(25,55%,30%)]\">En savoir plus <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-xl\"><img alt=\"Culte à l&#x27;Église Francophone CBCO Kintambo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/church-interior.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-[hsl(30,25%,96%)]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[hsl(25,20%,15%)] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-newspaper inline-block h-8 w-8 mr-2 text-[hsl(25,55%,35%)]\"><path d=\"M4 22h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Zm0 0a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-9c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 14h-8\"></path><path d=\"M15 18h-5\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h8v4h-8V6Z\"></path></svg>Nos <span class=\"text-[hsl(25,55%,35%)]\">actualités</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Restez informé des dernières nouvelles de notre église</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground h-full overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 border-none shadow group bg-white\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-gray-200\"><img alt=\"CONFERENCE-DEBAT\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/uploads/news/18_JUILLET_1783846449968.jpeg\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4 mr-2\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>12 juillet 2026</div><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg line-clamp-2 text-[hsl(25,20%,15%)]\">CONFERENCE-DEBAT</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm line-clamp-3\">Venons nombreux pour acquérir des connaissances précieuses, poser des questions en toute liberté et partager un moment d&#x27;édification mutuelle. </p></div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground h-full overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 border-none shadow group bg-white\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-gray-200\"><img alt=\"Mise à la retraite du pasteur Pierre NDONGANANI\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/uploads/news/Retraite_1780849366142.jpeg\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4 mr-2\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>12 juillet 2026</div><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg line-clamp-2 text-[hsl(25,20%,15%)]\">Mise à la retraite du pasteur Pierre NDONGANANI</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm line-clamp-3\">Invitation au culte et appel à contribution pour la mise à la retraite du pasteur Pierre NDONGANANI</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border shadow-sm h-full bg-[hsl(25,55%,35%)] text-white border-none overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"p-8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart h-12 w-12 mb-4 text-[hsl(35,50%,75%)]\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3\">Faire une offrande</h3><p class=\"mb-6 text-white/80\">Soutenez l&#x27;œuvre de Dieu à travers vos dîmes et offrandes. Votre générosité permet à l&#x27;église de continuer sa mission.</p><a href=\"/mon-offrande\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 h-10 px-4 py-2 bg-white text-[hsl(25,55%,35%)] hover:bg-gray-100\">Donner maintenant <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a></div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm h-full bg-[hsl(35,40%,85%)] border-none overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"p-8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-churc